Here's the full performance analysis:

---

## Scan Execution Checklist

| Recipe | Hits |
|--------|------|
| `.Substring(` | 2 (L79) |
| `.ToLower()`/`.ToUpper()` | 2 (L79, L121) |
| `RegexOptions.Compiled` | 7 (3 pre-NET7 fallback, 3 Underscore, 1 InflectionRule) |
